        {
          "do": "discover",
          "id": "museum_secondbrain"
        },
        {
          "do": "inspect",
          "title": "Second Brain",
          "text": "Second Brain is the reference system Skye built in April 2026, and it is not a to-do list. It records what she is working on, where every project’s files live across her drives, why she made each decision (a decision log) and how fast she ships, with a section called My Lore for her creative philosophy. She writes to it as she works, in a journal of what shipped each day, so that future-Skye and any new AI session can start from what is on file. It was the foundation for a visualizer meant to show who she actually is.",
          "kicker": "Discovery"
        }
      ]
    },
